<p>When you are dealt a blow that reduces your life by at least <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 12%, 11%, 9%, 8%,</acronym> you have a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">47%, 52%, 56%, 58%, 60%</acronym> chance to reduce the remaining cooldown of all your talents by 1.</p><p>Temporary life from Sanguine Infusion will not count against the damage threshold.</p><p>The chance will increase with your Spellpower.</p>